motivation: Start while the room is quiet. Your effort does not need an audience.
discipline: Put your shoes by the door. Tomorrow you will not argue with yourself.
money: Quiet savings buy the freedom to say no, and ownership is the slow reward.
mindset: Doubt can speak. It just does not get to sign my permission slip.
fact: A photon can take thousands of years to escape the sun's core.
books: Treat every product as an experiment; measure what customers do, not what they promise.
stoic: Hard days train the mind the way steep hills train the legs. Keep climbing.
